      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guthrie%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Andrew Chester Tackitt platted Guthrie in 1891, opened its post office the next year, and built the first one‑room school.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
